# Candidate servers for amd64. scripts/gen-mirrorlist probes them and writes the
# fastest after the anchors.
#
# A `source` line names where to read candidates. gen-mirrorlist reads the
# sources in order and uses the first that gives candidates:
#   status-json URL                 the mirror status of archlinux.org
#   mirrorlist URL                  a mirrorlist file
#   mirrorlist-package DB PKG PATH  the file PATH in package PKG of database DB
source = status-json https://archlinux.org/mirrors/status/json/
source = mirrorlist-package https://ghcr.mirror.archlinux.pkgforge.dev/x86_64/core/core.db pacman-mirrorlist etc/pacman.d/mirrorlist
